# .worktreeinclude — gitignore syntax.
# Copies gitignored-but-present files from the main checkout into every new
# worktree. A git worktree only checks out TRACKED files; these are ignored,
# so without this list they vanish in worktrees.
#
# COPY vs LINK: this file COPIES, which suits static config only. The living
# stores — .claude/context (knowledge base) and .claude/memory — must NOT be
# copied: a copy forks them and worktree-side writes never reach the real
# store. Those two are SYMLINKED into each worktree instead (one physical
# home in the main checkout). Do not add them here.

# Local agent source: system-prompts, sub-agents, skills
.agents/

# Personal, machine-local overrides.
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json

# Writing-standards config read by the ste100 checkers.
.claude/ste100.json
